{title: Laila Mai Laila}
{artist: Kalyanji Anandji Qurbani}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm] Laila mai [Bb] laila aisi hu [Cm] laila,        Har koi [Bb] chahe mujhse milna [Gm] akela
[Gm] Jisko bhi [Cm] dekhu duniya bhu [Bb] la du,        Majnu ba [F] na doon aisi main [Gm] laila
O [Bb] mohabbat ka jisko tareeqa na [F] aaya,        [F] Usse zindagi ka saleeka na [Gm] aaya
[Gm] Raahe va [Cm] fa mein jaan par jo [Bb] khela,        Uske li [F] ye hai yeh haseenon ka [Gm] mela
Mujhe [Bb] dekhkar jo na dekhe [F] kisi ko,        [F] Mere vaaste jo mita de [Gm] khudi ko
[Gm] Ussi di [Cm] wane ki banungi mai [Bb] laila,        Usse pyaar [F] doongi main pehla [Gm] pehla
